{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<strong> Supermarket Guard Simulator</strong>\u00a0you play as a security guard in a store simulator setting, whose job is to prevent shoplifting and drive supermarket profits to keep shareholders happy, regardless of the cost. Setup security systems, catch thieves,\u00a0protect the store, take on orders from management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conducting Surveillance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track customers' movements and perform inspections using various devices. You don't want to disturb them with your presence, but still want to keep an eye on everyone.\u00a0Use everything at your disposal to spot potential thieves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/0d3b33a7fab15d3f404e9409b82782b8.poster.avif?t=1774185255\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/0d3b33a7fab15d3f404e9409b82782b8.webm?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/0d3b33a7fab15d3f404e9409b82782b8.mp4?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch Criminals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you spot a thief do whatever it takes to stop them. React quick as they are very fast, sometimes aggressive and dangerous. Remember, company profits are the number one priority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/ff4c63d2a4803ffafbbc39802d53bb2d.poster.avif?t=1774185255\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/ff4c63d2a4803ffafbbc39802d53bb2d.webm?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/ff4c63d2a4803ffafbbc39802d53bb2d.mp4?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Setup Robust Security</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cutting-edge tech to build systems that catch thieves red-handed. Gear up with a range of security tools to help you stop them.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/7e98e3f8f909003ad85c03a1385b1368.poster.avif?t=1774185255\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/7e98e3f8f909003ad85c03a1385b1368.webm?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/7e98e3f8f909003ad85c03a1385b1368.mp4?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enforce Store Policies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure no supermarket policy is violated. This is good for the business and keeps customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/842a32fe2dab60ee0d376ed580e6a9af.poster.avif?t=1774185255\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/842a32fe2dab60ee0d376ed580e6a9af.webm?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/842a32fe2dab60ee0d376ed580e6a9af.mp4?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This business is very territorial and competitive. Protect the supermarket reputation at any cost. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/cafc59d7ec49b11836f3b617411e3170.poster.avif?t=1774185255\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/cafc59d7ec49b11836f3b617411e3170.webm?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/cafc59d7ec49b11836f3b617411e3170.mp4?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring Shareholder Value</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do everything a real security guard would do to bring massive value to the Shareholders. Do your best and grind that promotion in <strong>Supermarket Guard Simulator</strong>! \ud83d\udc6e</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720580?t=1774185255","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720580?t=1774185255","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/a618de1c42f3852fb62993b26dfd08a76b1ba369/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774185255","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/a618de1c42f3852fb62993b26dfd08a76b1ba369/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774185255","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"b