\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/ff4c63d2a4803ffafbbc39802d53bb2d.mp4?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Setup Robust Security</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cutting-edge tech to build systems that catch thieves red-handed. Gear up with a range of security tools to help you stop them.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/7e98e3f8f909003ad85c03a1385b1368.poster.avif?t=1774185255\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/7e98e3f8f909003ad85c03a1385b1368.webm?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/7e98e3f8f909003ad85c03a1385b1368.mp4?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enforce Store Policies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure no supermarket policy is violated. This is good for the business and keeps customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/842a32fe2dab60ee0d376ed580e6a9af.poster.avif?t=1774185255\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/842a32fe2dab60ee0d376ed580e6a9af.webm?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/842a32fe2dab60ee0d376ed580e6a9af.mp4?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This business is very territorial and competitive. Protect the supermarket reputation at any cost. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/cafc59d7ec49b11836f3b617411e3170.poster.avif?t=1774185255\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/cafc59d7ec49b11836f3b617411e3170.webm?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/cafc59d7ec49b11836f3b617411e3170.mp4?t=1774185255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring Shareholder Value</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do everything a real security guard would do to bring massive value to the Shareholders. Do your best and grind that promotion in <strong>Supermarket Guard Simulator</strong>! \ud83d\udc6e</p>","developers":["Borrowed Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/eb21c945d6e1ec9f5184c11823d6f0675d9eec26/header.jpg?t=1774185255","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3720580/488999051/3023ba6661edca86f1ed75502127fdda8e676149/1769932219/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769932915","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3720580/488999051/3023ba6661edca86f1ed75502127fdda8e676149/1769932219/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769932915","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai